Z||000000||FieroKyle||11-07-2001||12:18 AM||||Alright, the V-6 Aurora is the 3.5L and the V-8 Aurora is the 4.0L. What kind of power outputs do these engines have? And can they be put in a Fiero? If anyone has any info or expierence, please reply. Thanks!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0PgAgVMwT!1W9RUb20vChbvv6QaE!2K1LWrFB6SxTnTchZgvIygv7Y3YwXpVdD8GeNkWpurYfoQxvNRK6j6kEmOFLoIHavbIr/Kyle-85-GT.jpg">    <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||1
