Z||000004||Philphine||11-08-2001||11:47 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by pHoOl:<BR><B>Isn't the 4.0 just a regular northstar?  i could be wrong on that, but i thought they put n*s into auroras<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>it is the same engine with a smaller displacement (bore? stroke? don't know which or combo of both). that may be why it's not used much. why take the drop in hp when a northstar will go in just as easy (hard). i think the person who would use the aurora engine is someone who got a good deal on it.<BR>||||reg||1
